## Complete the Network Services

Generate the host, network, DNS, and DHCP configuration from the node
definitions:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Complete networking setup -->
```bash
# Generate /etc/hosts and network definitions from the node defs
makehosts
makenetworks

# makedns must run before makedhcp: xCAT's Kea DHCP-DDNS integration
# requires the DDNS key material that makedns generates
makedns -n
makedhcp -n
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
